---
title: Proposition 23
---
order: 23
---
short_label: V.23
---
statement: If there are three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, and the proportion of them be perturbed, then they are also in the same ratio <i>ex aequali.</i>
---
proof:

